  unitName: Woodland Fairy Finia
  unitId: 30262
  unitNumber: 634
  description: A wicked demon known as the leader of the Tinpalls. Although she seems
    very cute, this demon wields terrifying powers. Living in the depths of the forest,
    she spends her life toying with the humans the Tinpalls bring with them. It is
    said that when famous warriors and clergymen visit the forest, these demons seek
    them out in order to corrupt them. The fairies have long been their enemy, and
    they constantly fight each other in places unknown to humans.
  summonDesc: Nice to meet you!<br>Are you a Summoner?<br>I will do my best!
  fusionDesc: That was delicious!<br>But I want to eat more.<br>Can I? Can I?
  evoDesc: Wow! Thanks a lot!<br>With this I can...hehe...
